{"id":"5b8f5b92f1d4cb67","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-display-correspondence-compat.md","title":"历史入口","display":"thm--display-correspondence — 历史入口","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-display-correspondence-compat","aliases":["16-thm-display-correspondence-compat","16-thm--display-correspondence"],"display":"thm--display-correspondence — 历史入口","depends_on":["[[16-thm-display-correspondence]]"],"source":"§10.4, pp. 613–615 (PDF 633–635)","revision_date":"2026-10-07"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-display-correspondence-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-display-correspondence-compat</span><span>16-thm--display-correspondence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm--display-correspondence — 历史入口"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"75a4c54baaa666ef\" href=\"?note=75a4c54baaa666ef\" title=\"16-thm-display-correspondence\">16-thm-display-correspondence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§10.4, pp. 613–615 (PDF 633–635)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-07"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FullComp}(p,\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{FullComp}(p,\\chi)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)\">\\(D=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf D\">\\(\\mathbf D\\)</span> 的态射是全部交换方块；定义及证明见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"75a4c54baaa666ef\" href=\"?note=75a4c54baaa666ef\" title=\"16-thm-display-correspondence\">16-thm-display-correspondence</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bar\\chi:\\mathcal E\\simeq\\mathbf D,\\qquad\\operatorname{cod}_D\\bar\\chi=p.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bar\\chi:\\mathcal E\\simeq\\mathbf D,\\qquad\\operatorname{cod}_D\\bar\\chi=p.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>历史入口与满理解定理一致，不能把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf D\">\\(\\mathbf D\\)</span> 的箭头缩成仅拉回方块。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，§10.4, pp. 613–615 (PDF 633–635)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-thm-display-correspondence","status":"resolved","id":"75a4c54baaa666ef","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-display-correspondence]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-display-correspondence","status":"resolved","id":"75a4c54baaa666ef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FullComp}(p,\\chi)$；$D=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)$，$\\mathbf D$ 的态射是全部交换方块；定义及证明见 [[16-thm-display-correspondence]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FullComp}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf D","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar\\chi:\\mathcal E\\simeq\\mathbf D,\\qquad\\operatorname{cod}_D\\bar\\chi=p.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf D","display":false}],"bytes":942,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-411","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-display-correspondence-compat|thm--display-correspondence — 历史入口]]"}],"outgoing":["75a4c54baaa666ef"]}